<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Quick Responses</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Pre-saved message templates you can instantly insert into the chat. Saves time when you frequently send similar replies.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">How to Use</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Create:</strong> Click "New Quick Response" and fill in the title, shortcode (e.g. <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/thanks</code>), and message body</li>
      <li><strong>Use in Chat:</strong> Type <strong>/</strong> followed by text to see matching quick responses</li>
      <li>Click on a suggestion to insert it into the message input</li>
      <li>Edit the text if needed, then send as normal</li>
      <li>The usage count tracks how often each quick response is used</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Rules</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Title</strong> and <strong>Body</strong> are required fields</li>
      <li><strong>Shortcode</strong> is optional but recommended (e.g. <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/thanks</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/pricing</code>)</li>
      <li>Shortcodes should be short, memorable, and start with <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/</code></li>
      <li>Quick responses you create are available only to you; shared responses (no owner) are available to all users</li>
      <li>The message body still respects the 4,096 character WhatsApp limit when sent</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Title can't be blank"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">You must provide a descriptive title for the quick response.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Body can't be blank"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The message body is required. Enter the text that will be inserted into the chat.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Tips</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Create responses for your most common replies: greetings, pricing, business hours, etc.</li>
      <li>Keep shortcodes simple and consistent (e.g. <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/hi</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/hours</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-[11px]">/address</code>)</li>
      <li>You can still edit the inserted text before sending</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
